{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-9","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：连比例与平方与立方","englishTitle":"If as many numbers as we please beginning from an unit be in continued proportion, and the number after the unit be square, all the rest will also be square. And, if the number after the unit be cube, all the rest will also be cube.","book":9,"number":9,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.9","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.9/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":9,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","contentId":"euclid-9-9","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"66cbaa0145a7d7a4729b63443c88be4d9f5fcdbfb53aae75384d14f4d413dc3f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-9.statement","euclid-9-9.construction.1","euclid-9-9.proof.1","euclid-9-9.proof.2","euclid-9-9.proof.3","euclid-9-9.proof.4","euclid-9-9.proof.5","euclid-9-9.proof.6","euclid-9-9.proof.7","euclid-9-9.proof.8","euclid-9-9.proof.9","euclid-9-9.proof.10","euclid-9-9.proof.11","euclid-9-9.proof.12","euclid-9-9.conclusion","euclid-9-9.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-9.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4aa8e5dc9b5abffa3d311a488d4b46ccec96aded43ad943e13a14be80ecf724b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If as many numbers as we please beginning from an unit be in continued proportion, and the number after the unit be square, all the rest will also be square. And, if the number after the unit be cube, all the rest will also be cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从单位开始的号码是连比例,单位之后的数字是平方数,那么其余的也将是平方数。 如果单位之后的数字是立方体,那么其余的也将是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ded0082324cf12665259c0ed5bc6f44f941a5da7ca8c5c681dad7a8738344c0a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be as many numbers as we please, A, B, C, D, E, F, beginning from an unit and in continued proportion, and let A, the number after the unit, be square; I say that all the rest will also be square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们尽可能多地多地数,A,B,C,D,E,F,从单位开始,连比例开始,A,单位之后的数字为平方数;我说,其余的也将是平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c1b665c945b2f01ed2c6efcca49fdbfe65e6cfa302a6d76c39b2fccd0587457","citations":["euclid-9-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now it has been proved that B, the third from the unit, is square, as are also all those which leave out one; [[IX. 8](/principles/euclid-9-8)] I say that all the rest are also square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,已经证明,单位中的第三个是B,而所有那些没有这样做的人也是平方数;我说,其余的也是平方数。 [[IX. 8](/principles/euclid-9-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3155d4b273589f9484bb4fba6c876fc45971753b5596e1629a0bc33d5d7c009a","citations":["euclid-8-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A, B, C are in continued proportion, and A is square, therefore C is also square. [[VIII. 22](/principles/euclid-8-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A,B,C在连比例,A在平方数,因此C也是平方数。 [[VIII. 22](/principles/euclid-8-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c061073bd20d8951b8ec0a917cc27a59a4ec5a9d02ba68d64835b7dd12d459b6","citations":["euclid-8-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since B, C, D are in continued proportion, and B is square, D is also square. [[VIII. 22](/principles/euclid-8-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B,C,D在连比例,B在平方数,D也在平方数。 [[VIII. 22](/principles/euclid-8-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ed7181657e3f3096c65eaa2484790700e3bea722681a083d00fe2ed8f5b06d1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that all the rest are also square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,其余的也是平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a6728c3b8def5826be32e9dac9d8c5e1885dca709d39976dfac240189e21df78","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let A be cube; I say that all the rest are also cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,让我们把A变成立方体;我说,其余的也是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a002763cbd6b585bb9ea361229863a05abc72f4a929a4a77fef644ca1c0d378f","citations":["euclid-9-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now it has been proved that C, the fourth from the unit, is cube, as also are all those which leave out two; [[IX. 8](/principles/euclid-9-8)] I say that all the rest are also cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,已经证明,单位的第四位C是立方体,而所有那些排除两个的也是立方体;我说,其余的也是立方体。 [[IX. 8](/principles/euclid-9-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0fff3d59e5a1b70671fabe7a54fd229968ebdc511f4162f6430ea99375e54119","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since, as the unit is to A, so is A to B, therefore the unit measures A the same number of times as A measures B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,单位对A的比等于A对B的比,因此,单位对整除对A的比是A对B的相同倍数,即A对B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1439e5fef5c5e62ae899e9ac224fa66c14612c80549bc7b9245bb5164005ca95","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit measures A according to the units in it; therefore A also measures B according to the units in itself; therefore A by multiplying itself has made B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据单位,单位,整除,A,单位,B,A,整除,B,A,B,A乘以乘以本身,就达到B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c99cc4206a18bfdaa4117ef0596ef4221b859d20ab50f100582bc3c76cda8adc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And A is cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A是立方体"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af492a6559fe0df1a41ec57790ee471202c5794627d1c73cc0125f86687c750a","citations":["euclid-9-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if a cube number by multiplying itself make some number, the product is cube. [[IX. 3](/principles/euclid-9-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果乘以立方数本身 得出一些数字, 产品就是立方体。 [[IX. 3](/principles/euclid-9-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"efc4b3ab8af3e31772037f6fb4f3eda225c07988f683689bfbe072a5c48c097b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore B is also cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以B也是立方体"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"364b1065a2c0e2753735957f1adafee977e372cc96ba6003583f2dfa9b46b9a1","citations":["euclid-8-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the four numbers A, B, C, D are in continued proportion, and A is cube, D also is cube. [[VIII. 23](/principles/euclid-8-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"4个号码A,B,C,D是连比例,A是立方体,D也是立方体。 [[VIII. 23](/principles/euclid-8-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":14,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"052c69ca3e0e9d6a2f3df3af37381fd34f5b8c600ad3fe650ac56aa0f88d057f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason E is also cube, and similarly all the rest are cube. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,E也是立方体,同样,其余的也是立方体Q. E. D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-9.source","contentId":"euclid-9-9","revisionId":"euclid-9-9@raw-66cbaa0145a7d7a4","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6dea4ed078847df012c90fd7e2d946c4b349b18c1ec9106d57d91233da1c7e7f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.9/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.9\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-9:euc